", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T17:10:32Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "One alchemist I can think of is Flamel", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T17:11:10Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "He is alive :)", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T17:11:18Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Or no actually he is dead", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T17:11:18Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Ouh", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T17:11:19Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Sorry", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T17:11:26Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Because harry destroyed the stone", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T17:11:51Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "4. His family was so embarrassed by the work that when he died, they hid the notebooks. They didn’t want Jeova Sanctus Unus to destroy the reputation of the man who wrote under that pseudonym.", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T17:12:04Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Oh but there was a historical figure named Nicholas flamel on whom the character is based", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T17:12:05Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Oh", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T17:12:18Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Pseudonym.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-30T17:12:21Z", "username":